<title>USA: Saratoga delays statement filing.</title>
<headline>Saratoga delays statement filing.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, N.J. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saratoga Brands Inc said Tuesday it had delayed filing its financial statements for the year 1996 until the end of April because of the accounting associated with acquisitions completed by the company during the year.</p>
<p>Saratoga said it anticipates releasing its financial results for the year, and being in full compliance with Securities and Exchange Commission and Nasdaq requirements, by month's end.</p>
</text>
